{"id":"n71353-1-10","stage":1,"title":"표 · 票","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71353-1-10-1","ko":"제주도에 여행 간다면서? 준비는 다 했어?","zh":"听说你要去济州岛旅行？准备都做好了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제주도에","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}},{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}},{"text":"간다면서?","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간다면서","audio":"/audio/697bef08b13e91212e3e.mp3"}},{"text":"준비는","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비는","audio":"/audio/55184fb1db2d9c50dfcb.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全、都","explanation":"다：全、都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"했어?","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term